===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂el- (grow)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|world}}, {{m|enm|weoreld}}, from {{inh|en|ang|weorold|t=world}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*weraldi}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*weraldiz|t=lifetime, human existence, world|lit=age/era of man}}, equivalent to {{com|ang|wer|t1=man|eld|t2=age|nocat=1}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|warld|t=world}}, {{cog|stq|Waareld|t=world}}, {{cog|fy|wrâld|t=world}}, {{cog|af|wêreld|t=world}}, {{cog|nl|wereld|t=world}}, {{cog|nds|Werld|t=world}}, {{cog|de|Welt|t=world}}, {{cog|nb|verden|t=(the) world}}, {{cog|nn|verd|t=world}}, {{cog|sv|värld|t=world}}, {{cog|is|veröld|t=world}}.

